    "custom_liquid_RiRAwi": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  BowFlex Treadmills FAQ\n  Shopify Custom Liquid\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<section class=\"bowflex-faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"bowflex-faq-container\">\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq-header\">\n      <span class=\"bowflex-faq-eyebrow\">TREADMILLS</span>\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n      <p>\n        Find out more about BowFlex treadmills, home space requirements, running surface sizes, model selection and connected training features.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq-group\">\n\n      <h3 class=\"bowflex-faq-category\">Product Fit &amp; Space</h3>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Why choose a BowFlex treadmill for home workouts?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex treadmills</strong> are a strong choice for home workouts because they combine speed, incline training, deck cushioning, foldable design and connected training options in one machine.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Instead of choosing between a basic walking treadmill and a full commercial gym treadmill, BowFlex treadmills offer practical home training features for <strong>walking, jogging, running, intervals and incline workouts</strong>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>How much space do I need for a BowFlex treadmill at home?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            Please check the product dimensions on the product page and leave enough clearance around the BowFlex treadmill for safe access, running movement, ventilation and emergency dismounting.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            We recommend measuring your room before purchase, including both the <strong>operating and folded dimensions</strong> if the model is foldable.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            If space is limited, a folding BowFlex treadmill such as <strong>BowFlex T6</strong> is a practical option for regular home walking, jogging and running. BowFlex T6 has stowed dimensions of <strong>111.8 × 89.8 × 172.7 cm</strong>.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            If you have more space and want a larger running area, <strong>BowFlex T9</strong> offers a <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60 × 22-inch running surface</strong> and stowed dimensions of <strong>123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm</strong>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>What running surface size should I choose for home walking, jogging, or running?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            For home treadmill training, the running surface should be large enough for your natural stride and workout speed.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            A compact running surface can work for walking and light jogging, while regular running, taller users, faster speeds and longer workouts usually feel more comfortable with a <strong>longer and wider running deck</strong>.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T6</strong> offers a <strong>50 × 152 cm running surface</strong> for regular home walking, jogging and running.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T9</strong> offers a larger <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60 × 22-inch running surface</strong> for users who want more width, longer-stride comfort and a more spacious running feel at home.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Which BowFlex treadmill is best for home use, T6 or T9?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            Both <strong>BowFlex T6</strong> and <strong>BowFlex T9</strong> are designed for home treadmill training, but they suit different needs.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T6</strong> is a practical folding treadmill for regular walking, jogging and running at home, with up to <strong>20 km/h / 12 mph speed</strong>, up to <strong>15% incline</strong>, Bluetooth, fitness app compatibility and smartwatch syncing.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T9</strong> is better suited for users who want more running space, stronger stability and a more advanced connected running experience, including a <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60 × 22-inch running area</strong>, up to <strong>20 km/h / 12 mph speed</strong>, up to <strong>15% incline</strong> and smartwatch syncing features.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq-group\">\n\n      <h3 class=\"bowflex-faq-category\">Performance &amp; Training Features</h3>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Can BowFlex treadmills connect to fitness apps and connected training features?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            BowFlex treadmill connected training features vary by model.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T6</strong> supports app-connected training with <strong>JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift</strong> through a compatible phone or tablet.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T9</strong> supports <strong>JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift</strong>, and can sync workout data with <strong>Apple Watch and Samsung Galaxy Watch</strong>.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex T25 / Treadmill 25</strong> includes a built-in touchscreen, Wi-Fi connection, JRNY training, Bluetooth heart rate tracking and Bluetooth speakers.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            These connected features can help users follow guided workouts, explore virtual routes, track performance data and make indoor running more engaging. Please check the specifications for the model available in your market.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .bowflex-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 60px 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #161616;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin-bottom: 45px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-eyebrow {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.8px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.8px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header p {\n    margin: 0;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555555;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-group {\n    margin-bottom: 42px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-group:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-category {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item {\n    border-top: 1px solid #dedede;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #dedede;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item summary {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-co